    "t-del": {"x": 0, "y": 8940, "text": "Delete confirmations", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 9522},
    "n-design": {"x": 3542, "y": 0, "w": 380, "fill": "orange", "text": "This page is the live app as it is today. Changes proposed for it, each drawn as Before and After side by side, are on the \"Proposed changes\" page (page menu, top left)."},
    "n-how": {"x": 3042, "y": 0, "w": 420, "text": "How the boards are built: each screen is one component board (Main = Transactions, Dashboard, Budgets, Categories, Investments, Loans, Recurring, SignIn; Loans also draws Instalments through its kind prop) that draws every state at both sizes, chosen by props: size is phone (iPhone 402 × 874, under 768 px wide) or desktop (1440 × 900). The other boards are small wrappers that mount it with different props, so a change to a screen is made once, in its component. Navigation lives in Nav. Every delete asks through one confirm dialog, drawn once in Confirm; the delete boards lay it over the screen it comes from.\n\nProposed changes: the components take a proposed prop. Off (the default, used on this page) draws the live app; on draws the proposal. The Proposed changes page sets it on its After boards.\n\nImages: the app icon, the Google logo and every Ant Design icon the app uses are uploaded to this canvas's image store and referenced as /_blob/ links. The icons are drawn through one shared stylesheet (also uploaded) as masks, so they take the text colour. That stylesheet also carries the app's own tokens and classes from src/index.css. A second uploaded stylesheet adds the classes from the live release b57ac88 (search in the title row, tappable spending rows, the full-screen phone form, the amount keypad).\n\nFollows the live site, financial-app-sooty.vercel.app, as of 23 November 2026: its layout, with sample data in place of the owner's real accounts and amounts. Today is Monday 23 November 2026, amounts in RM.", "fill": "teal", "size": "s"},

    "pt-del": {"page": "proposed", "x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "1 · Delete dialog redesign", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 4404},
    "pn-del": {"page": "proposed", "x": 4004, "y": 0, "w": 400, "fill": "orange", "text": "Before: Ant Design's stock confirm. \"Delete?\" with no name, a yellow warning icon, small 32 px buttons and a different red from the rest of the app.\n\nAfter: the app's own form style. A 16 px panel, a red bin chip, a title that names the thing, a line saying exactly what goes, and the app's 42 px pill buttons. On phone it is a bottom sheet with full-width Delete and Cancel.\n\nSame change for budget, category, instalment and loan-adjustment deletes."},
    "pt-tx": {"page": "proposed", "x": 0, "y": 1020, "text": "2 · Transactions: money format, month picker, dark category colours", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 4404},
    "pn-tx": {"page": "proposed", "x": 4004, "y": 1320, "w": 400, "fill": "orange", "text": "Money: a sign then a space then RM, always 2 decimals: \"+ RM 4,381.35\", \"− RM 12.50\" (was \"+RM\", \"−RM\").\n\nMonth picker: drawn like the form fields, 44 tall with a 1.5 px border and 10 px corners (was a 32 px Ant Design picker).\n\nDark category colours: Car (#383838) and Cat (#000000) show as a solid tile in their colour with a light rim and a white icon. Before, their icons nearly vanish (see Petrol and Cat food). The chart swatches get the same rim."},
    "pt-dash": {"page": "proposed", "x": 0, "y": 2340, "text": "3 · Dashboard: money format and row labels", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 4280},
    "pn-dash": {"page": "proposed", "x": 4360, "y": 2640, "w": 400, "fill": "orange", "text": "Money: net worth reads \"− RM 351,693.18\" (was \"RM -351,693.18\"); assets, liabilities and yearly gain get 2 decimals; account rows say RM instead of MYR, with a space after the minus.\n\nRow labels, approved 23 Nov 2026 and drawn on the After board: the second line stops repeating the group. Investments show the symbol, with type, units and gain underneath; loans show rate type, rate and months paid; instalments show the monthly amount and months paid; bank accounts and cards keep type · bank. The labels board just left of this note compares them with today's."},
    "pt-loans": {"page": "proposed", "x": 0, "y": 3660, "text": "4 · Loans and Investments: 2 decimals, sidebar Loans icon", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 6000},
    "pn-loans": {"page": "proposed", "x": 6080, "y": 3960, "w": 400, "fill": "orange", "text": "Loans: Borrowed, Total interest and the donut total get 2 decimals (RM 505,000.00, RM 481,048.00, RM 447,607.16).\n\nSidebar: the Loans icon becomes the account book the phone bar already uses (was a dollar coin). Visible on every After board.\n\nInvestments: price and average cost always 2 decimals; gains read \"+ USD 1,212.50\" and \"+ RM 19,337.37\"."},
    "pt-cat": {"page": "proposed", "x": 0, "y": 4980, "text": "5 · Categories: very dark colours", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2960},
    "pn-cat": {"page": "proposed", "x": 3040, "y": 5280, "w": 400, "fill": "orange", "text": "Car (#383838) and Cat (#000000): before, a 24% tint of a near-black colour disappears on the dark panel, so the tile and icon are almost invisible. After, the tile is filled with the real colour, with a light rim and a white icon. Every other colour is unchanged."},
    "pn-skip": {"page": "proposed", "x": 3520, "y": 5280, "w": 400, "fill": "gray", "text": "Not on this page:\n\n• One form pattern on phone (Transactions is a full-screen page, the rest are bottom sheets): later.\n• Budgets: left as it is.\n• Where the Delete buttons sit: fine for now."}
  },
